uld be a good optimization. I haven't tested it yet, but I think you would still get the edge case where particles that are a really large distance (SDF_MAX_LENGTH) from a collider are invisible. This would still be due to the encoding issue.\r\n\r\nEdit: Here's an example where I changed the SDF_MAX_LENGTH from 16384 to 128 to show what would happen: (particles that are too far away from the collider disappear, because they are being treated as colliding at max distance.)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/477d3aa3-12f5-44f8-a66a-ad084131fdb0\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6250222984/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6270713041","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124564#issuecomment-6270713041","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124564","id":6270713041,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABdcN80Q","user":{"login":"BaconEggsRL","id":18596035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTk2MDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18596035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL","html_url":"https://github.com/BaconEggsRL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/events{/privacy}"